{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to <strong>Schr\u00f6dinger's Maze</strong> \u2013 an adventure set in a world of quantum vision!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this maze, only what\u2019s within your line of sight <strong>truly exists</strong>. Everything beyond it falls into a quantum superposition\u2014caught between existence and oblivion.<br>A single step can flip your reality: what appears to be a wall might be an illusion; what seems like an enemy could be a hidden treasure or a key!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift your perspective to clear the fog of uncertainty. When all paths seem blocked, change your view\u2014<strong>a new way forward may reveal itself where none seemed to exist</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Combat follows a tower-style strategy system</strong>:<br>Absorb gems, unlock chests, upgrade gear, activate your skill tree, and defeat powerful bosses as you gradually unlock your quantum potential.<br>Ultimately, <strong>become the one who uncovers the true nature of the Maze</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 Special Crossover Event: <i>Schr\u00f6dinger\u2019s Maze \u00d7 Dungeon of the Magic Tower</i> Now Live!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All characters unlocked in <i>Dungeon of the Magic Tower</i> are now fully playable in <i>Schr\u00f6dinger\u2019s Maze</i>!<br>With over <strong>30 unique characters</strong> to choose from, build your own multiverse exploration team and dive into the unknown!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3714550?t=1761533664","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3714550?t=1761533664","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714550/d4bb45105e6a2ba250be54157f4ef5e0dc19d8e9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761533664","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714550/d4bb45105e6a2